{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"title":"Receiving credentials"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Receiving credentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Receiving-credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization code:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pre-authorized code:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the issuer has already authenticated the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Receive-an-offer","text":"Receive an offer"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `confirm` shows the","\/\/\/ holder who is offering what, and returns whether they want it;","\/\/\/ `askPIN` asks for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they","\/\/\/ cancel; `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect","\/\/\/ back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Offer) async -> Bool,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    do {","        guard await confirm(issuance.offer) else {","            try await issuance.close()","            return nil","        }","        switch issuance.offer.grant {","        case .preAuthorizedCode:","            while true {","                guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                    try await issuance.close()","                    return nil","                }","                do {","                    try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                    break","                } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                    continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","                }","            }","        case .authorizationCode:","            let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","            let redirect = try await signIn(url)","            try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","        }","        let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","        try await issuance.close()","        return result","    } catch {","        \/\/ End the issuance whatever failed, deleting its keys.","        try? await issuance.close()","        throw error","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show the offer before anything is redeemed: the issuer’s name and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials it offers, so the holder can turn down an offer they didn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expect. Close the issuance on every path, as here: its keys are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted then, but for those a deferred credential still needs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","text":"Open the issuer’s page"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","text":"Resume after the app is killed"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":". Outside development, resuming needs a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":" with the app’s own URI scheme, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":", so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses an https Universal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Link there. In development too, the scheme must be a domain name in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse order followed by a single slash, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reverse.domain:\/path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(RFC 8252 §7.1): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"myapp:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:callback"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":", and any redirect URI with a fragment or credentials."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","text":"Wait for a deferred credential"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access token has expired, say ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","text":"Look after held credentials"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns one with its claims, for display. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which one is checked."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), so presentations can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked by the credential. When "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" replaces them, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance kept a refresh token ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise it throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": receive the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential again. A refresh needs no sign-in, but the new copies’"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder keys sign the Credential Request’s proof, so with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks the holder too."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer."}]}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/beginAuthorization()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/beginauthorization()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Begins the authorization code grant, returning the issuer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization URL to open in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":". Calling it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again begins again: after the holder closed the page, say."}],"title":"beginAuthorization()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beginAuthorization","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/copiesLeft":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/copiesleft","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many copies no Verifier has seen."}],"title":"copiesLeft","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copiesLeft","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requestRefresh":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requestrefresh","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks Authorization Servers for a refresh token, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Wallet.refreshCredential(id:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can later replace a credential’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copies without the holder signing in. The server must allow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet the "},{"code":"offline_access","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scope, or the authorization fails."}],"title":"requestRefresh","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestRefresh"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startIssuance(offer:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startissuance(offer:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolves a Credential Offer (openid-credential-offer:\/\/…) and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuer’s metadata."}],"title":"startIssuance(offer:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startIssuance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"offer","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issuance","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet8IssuanceC"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/Result":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/result","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":" obtained."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Result"}],"title":"Issuance.Result","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Result"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredStatus":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredstatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A deferred credential’s state, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.pollDeferred(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DeferredStatus"}],"title":"DeferredStatus","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DeferredStatus"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredcredential","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential an issuer will issue later (OpenID4VCI 1.0 §9). It’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it survives the app quitting."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DeferredCredential"}],"title":"DeferredCredential","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DeferredCredential"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/credential(id:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/credential(id:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One credential with its claims."}],"title":"credential(id:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credential","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16CredentialDetailV","text":"CredentialDetail"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/resumeIssuance(redirect:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/resumeissuance(redirect:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completes an authorization begun before the app was suspended or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relaunched: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirect"},{"type":"text","text":" is the issuer’s redirect back to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI, delivered to the app ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":"). Returns the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance ready for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":". A redirect matching no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization in progress — not this wallet’s, already completed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or expired — throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".notFound"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"resumeIssuance(redirect:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resumeIssuance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"redirect","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Issuance","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet8IssuanceC"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/notFound":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/notfound","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"No key, credential, deferred credential or authorization in progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with that ID."}],"title":"notFound","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notFound"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/checkStatus(id:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/checkstatus(id:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the issuer’s status list for a credential, checks its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signature, and returns the credential with its revocation status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded. The list covers many credentials, so fetching it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t tell the issuer which one is checked. A credential without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a status list is returned as it is."}],"title":"checkStatus(id:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIden